      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "じゃが、ここから西にある\r\nミシディアの塔にいけば可能じゃ。\r\nすぐに向かうぞ。",
        "official_en": "Yet there is a way if we travel west from here to the Tower of Mysidia. We shall make haste.",
        "real_en": "But we can do it at the Tower of Mysidia, west of here. Let's go at once."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
