      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "でも、７００年前の君とは会えたぜ。\r\n今と全然、変わってなかったよ。",
        "official_en": "But we did meet a version of you from seven centuries ago. You haven’t changed a bit from back then, have you?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
