        "official_en_sha256": "3c268faac72b09c221884673834a80fe63703b0dbdec3b27ba05f0e140781e0a"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "７００年前のパラデイアを再現するには\r\n魔人フィーナの記憶だけでは不十分のようじゃ。",
        "official_en": "Her memories alone are insufficient to recreate what transpired seven hundred years ago.",
        "real_en": "It seems Dark Fina's memories alone aren't enough to recreate Paladia as it was 700 years ago."
      },
